sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as approver / scheduled job
    participant LT as labeltree-db
    participant W as WoRMS API

    U->>LT: GET /trees/taxonomy/drift
    LT->>LT: last_drift_run, set of AphiaIDs used in latest rev
    LT->>W: AphiaRecordsByDate(start=last_drift_run, end=now) (paged)
    W-->>LT: records modified in window
    LT->>LT: intersect with our AphiaIDs
    loop each changed AphiaID
        LT->>W: AphiaRecordByID + AphiaClassificationByAphiaID
        W-->>LT: current status, valid_AphiaID, lineage
        LT->>LT: compare with cached_record, re-run placement checks
    end
    LT-->>U: report: became unaccepted, lineage moved, rank changed, new warnings
    opt accept proposals
        U->>LT: open draft from report
        LT-->>U: changeset with proposed atomic changes (normal review)
    end
